{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-1783","published":"2026-03-27T11:10:48Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:19:43.922198732Z","upstream":["CVE-2019-13147","CVE-2025-50950"],"summary":"audiofile security update","details":"The Audio File Library is a C-based library for reading and writing audio files in many common formats.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nIn Audio File Library (aka audiofile) 0.3.6, there exists one NULL pointer dereference bug in ulaw2linear_buf in G711.cpp in libmodules.a that allows an attacker to cause a denial of service via a crafted file.(CVE-2019-13147)\n\nAudiofile v0.3.7 was discovered to contain a NULL pointer dereference via the ModuleState::setup function.(CVE-2025-50950)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"audiofile","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP1","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/audiofile&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.3.6-30.oe2403sp1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["audiofile-0.3.6-30.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","audiofile-debuginfo-0.3.6-30.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","audiofile-debugsource-0.3.6-30.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","audiofile-devel-0.3.6-30.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["audiofile-help-0.3.6-30.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm"],"src":["audiofile-0.3.6-30.oe2403sp1.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["audiofile-0.3.6-30.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","audiofile-debuginfo-0.3.6-30.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","audiofile-debugsource-0.3.6-30.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","audiofile-devel-0.3.6-30.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-1783.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.openeuler.org/zh/security/security-bulletins/detail/?id=openEuler-SA-2026-1783"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2019-13147"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-50950"}],"database_specific":{"severity":"High"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V3","score":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H"}]}